blocks.en:
Figure 6: Analysis of stateful multi-turn multimodal interaction. (a) Measuring the understanding-realization gap, lower is better;
(b) comparing performance at the first and last image-generation turns under GT-History, to assess the effect of increasingly accumulated context and state dependencies;
(c) comparing GT-History with Self-History on dialogues to measure error accumulation when self-generated images are used as subsequent visual context.

blocks.zh:
图6:状态多回合多模式互动分析. (a) 衡量理解-实现差距,较低水平更好;
(b) 在GT-历史下比较第一次和最后一次图像生成时的表现,以评估不断积累的背景和状态依赖性的影响;
(c) 在对话上将GT-History与自来历史进行比较,以衡量自来生成的图像作为后继视觉上下文时出现的出错积累。
